\\term{targetTop}{z_t}-c\\,\\term{distance}{D}^{2}-z_o}{D},\\quad \\term{code}{v}=\\begin{cases}0&S>T+\\term{band}{\\beta}\\\\1&S\\le T-\\beta\\\\4&\\text{otherwise}\\end{cases},\\quad \\term{clearance}{C}=(T-S)D","ascii":"D=length((target-observer)*cellSize); S=max((bilinearHeight-c*s*s-eye)/s) at k=1..ceil(max(abs(delta)))-1, skipping invalid samples and stopping beyond D-max(ignoreDistance,ignoreFraction*D); T=(targetTop-c*D*D-eye)/D; beta=(toleranceMeters+tolerancePerKilometer*D/1000)/D; hidden=0 if S>T+beta, visible=1 if S<=T-beta, otherwise marginal=4; invalid endpoints give noData=3, D>maximumDistance>0 gives outOfRange=2, D=0 gives visible; no tested samples give visible. Clearance=(T-S)*D, 3.4028234663852886e38 for coincident points or no tested sample, NaN for noData or outOfRange; requesting clearance disables hidden-ray early exit.","derivation":"curated","symbols":[{"id":"maximum","role":"intermediate","label":"maximum sample tangent","binding":"wgsl:maxSlope"},{"id":"sample","role":"input","label":"bilinear sample","binding":"wgsl:elevationSample"},{"id":"curvature","role":"parameter","label":"curvature coefficient","binding":"wgsl:curvature"},{"id":"sampleDistance","role":"intermediate","label":"sample distance","binding":"wgsl:sampleDistance"},{"id":"eye","role":"input","label":"eye elevation","binding":"wgsl:eye"},{"id":"target","role":"intermediate","label":"target tangent","binding":"wgsl:targetSlope"},{"id":"targetTop","role":"input","label":"target elevation","binding":"wgsl:targetTop"},{"id":"distance","role":"intermediate","label":"target distance","binding":"wgsl:targetDistance"},{"id":"code","role":"output","label":"visibility code","binding":"wgsl:code"},{"id":"band","role":"parameter","label":"tolerance band","binding":"wgsl:band"},{"id":"clearance","role":"output","label":"clearance (m)","binding":"wgsl:clearance"}]}],"sources":[{"id":"wgsl:f77aec6e","language":"wgsl","moduleId":"GPUTerrainLineOfSight/march","hash":"f77aec6e","bodyHash":"